[
  {
    "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-53515a0f350011e18b5c-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "table",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "本人が配偶者の健康保険の扶養から外れる。",
        "text_hash": "8e31e5fcb4a49222933e",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-09d262eea61505a50005-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "table",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "一般の130万円未満基準では、本人が配偶者の健康保険の扶養から外れる（60歳以上または障害者は180万円未満の別基準）。",
        "text_hash": "8c41f85e6177fee14c58",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-74bde349ce648743ce7d-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "text",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "扶養から外れる",
        "text_hash": "a3f48bab7619ede99861",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-7ed422600ab6ffc81bb2-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "text",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "一般の扶養基準",
        "text_hash": "09d48b081aa810579ee9",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
    "before": [],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-de03bdcbbe4e5a8f82fa-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "figcaption",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "図の130万円は一般の扶養収入基準で、130万円以上の見込みになると対象外。",
        "text_hash": "e3b12dfc2ba8e8ccc935",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-9e2c655f04df751cdd45-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "figcaption",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "60歳以上または障害者は180万円未満、19歳以上23歳未満（配偶者を除く）は150万円未満の別基準があります。",
        "text_hash": "89e4b8f23eaf3930cac9",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-c745d9dcc63613f476d2-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "table",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "入れなければ国民健康保険＋国民年金を全額自己負担",
        "text_hash": "29fcdf23452be0334fa1",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-07b1809289982baa39a2-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "table",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "入れない場合は、年齢等に応じて国民健康保険・国民年金等への加入と負担を確認",
        "text_hash": "0e8cd1736bc4a3ad5538",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-cc0409c82b819a2aae16-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "一 令和八年分及び令和九年分…イ 合計所得金額が四百八十九万円以下である場合四十二万円／ロ 四百八十九万円を超える場合 五万円、二 令和十年分以後の各年分 三十七万円（同号は合計所得金額132万円以下の場合に適用）。",
        "text_hash": "899860964d630a84b548",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-c530acbdd2cedd7f2704-1",
        "page": "docs/column/nenshu-no-kabe/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "一 令和八年分及び令和九年分…イ 合計所得金額が四百八十九万円以下である場合四十二万円／ロ 四百八十九万円を超える場合 五万円（加算対象は合計所得金額655万円以下）、二 令和十年分以後の各年分 三十七万円（同号は合計所得金額132万円以下の場合に適用）。",
        "text_hash": "9f09e101dd6218efc280",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-1a060546504072b18a89-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "text",
        "zone": "summary",
        "protected": true,
        "text": "③ 次の5つを すべて 満たしますか？",
        "text_hash": "055d655d49abc1efb3a7",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-3183d4072b0a4c7abdf6-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "text",
        "zone": "summary",
        "protected": true,
        "text": "③ 次の要件を満たしますか？（賃金要件は2026年9月30日まで）",
        "text_hash": "87ac273bf547ddbd69f8",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-043c38a0900d23c49508-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "summary",
        "protected": true,
        "text": "絶対的な水準（20時間・8.8万円）",
        "text_hash": "3f546a45778deda4ef69",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-d8e6507c27781c1caf6b-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "summary",
        "protected": true,
        "text": "絶対的な水準（週20時間等。",
        "text_hash": "31751f685c517f8a5644",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-eec2627f24cf985ad2ef-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "td",
        "zone": "summary",
        "protected": true,
        "text": "月8.8万円は2026年9月30日まで）",
        "text_hash": "5959d8e7882050728fa5",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-f33e3de2545907ce8c0c-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "p",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "たとえば東京都・月給10万円・30歳なら、標準報酬月額は98,000円（健康保険5等級）。",
        "text_hash": "3fc88ca21b62d4383623",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-81de4a0b44a515256e5e-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "p",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "たとえば東京都・月給10万円・30歳なら、標準報酬月額は98,000円。",
        "text_hash": "b103adb55d9b8e002cf9",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-84925edef011d952a3dd-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "p",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "日本年金機構のQ&A集は「基本給及び諸手当で判断します」としたうえで、次の4つを算入しないと定めています。",
        "text_hash": "aa10b927c69105975c58",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-e65d19d5792e66b1d004-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "p",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "日本年金機構は「各諸手当等を含めた所定内賃金」の額で判定し、次の4つを算入しないと定めています。",
        "text_hash": "86927418a89bff7e6567",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-aeca190d9bfdf0b85f39-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "標準報酬月額88,000円の人なら、本人負担は本来の25/50（半分）から始まります",
        "text_hash": "7a0d7c3d791eb4330545",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-7b60e96c717e81027718-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "標準報酬月額88,000円で制度の対象となる人は、対象保険料の全額に対する本人負担が1〜2年目25%、3年目37.5%になります（通常の本人負担50%と比較）。",
        "text_hash": "a8c8fdf6b47f8e0ff9ed",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-0fb6c579749f2c442565-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "賞与・介護保険料・子ども・子育て支援金は軽減対象外です",
        "text_hash": "8494b77ddde5089266a0",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-3efd01ff32b55bdf9c55-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "p",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "4分の3基準未満の場合、週20時間以上・従業員51人以上の企業等に勤務することに加え、所定内賃金月8.8万円以上（2026年9月30日まで。",
        "text_hash": "056c0f7d01c43da06a16",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-d97723327168589ca3de-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "p",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "4分の3基準未満の場合、週20時間以上で、特定適用事業所（厚生年金の被保険者数が51人以上の企業等）・任意特定適用事業所・国または地方公共団体の事業所のいずれかに勤務することに加え、所定内賃金月8.8万円以上（2026年9月30日まで。",
        "text_hash": "d4a3a1789fa867e5d034",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
    "before": [
      {
        "id": "s-11eee93664c3a0a81ac8-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "加入の入口は2つだけ。",
        "text_hash": "307a4c631f08ebcd2a42",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-84a544a2c60bc14687d8-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "①4分の3基準（企業規模も賃金も無関係）→ ②適用拡大の5要件",
        "text_hash": "f430ddf360c9f841050f",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-9dc1e82f7b4ed82e255e-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "②の要件は週20時間・月8.8万円・2か月超・学生でない（休学・夜間・卒業前就職等の例外あり）・特定適用・任意特定適用・国等の事業所（令和8年10月1日前）",
        "text_hash": "141085118efa405ea4a7",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "id": "s-e36d93f514e691017e13-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "加入の入口は2つ。",
        "text_hash": "0e37b7b9f9e6fca11157",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-638c5cdd25b232970dd0-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "①4分の3基準（企業規模も賃金も無関係）→ ②適用拡大の要件（賃金要件は2026年9月30日まで）",
        "text_hash": "8ffcfea0b00d3261a710",
        "element_id": null
      },
      {
        "id": "s-171d0f006ccbae1f3e2f-1",
        "page": "docs/column/shakai-hoken-kanyu-joken/index.html",
        "kind": "li",
        "zone": "body",
        "protected": false,
        "text": "②の要件は週20時間・月8.8万円（2026年9月30日まで）・2か月超・学生でない（休学・夜間・卒業前就職等の例外あり）・特定適用・任意特定適用・国等の事業所",
        "text_hash": "0335803ab907362d7580",
        "element_id": null
      }
    ]
  }
